title: SurvivorFirst
---
Survivor: We shut the transmitter down. The Burrower follows the evacuation signal. Every call brings it closer. #emotion:Worried
Taren: So everyone who came to help led it back here. #emotion:Worried
Survivor: The survey key is in the control cradle beyond it. Its route has gaps. Check the bore before you trust that chart. #emotion:Determined
===
title: SurvivorRepeat
---
Survivor: Follow any ridge to the drill. They all lead to the same bad idea. #emotion:Worried
===
title: SurvivorPost
---
Survivor: Quiet. Real quiet. I had forgotten it could feel like this. #emotion:Tender
Survivor: The bore opens under the control cradle. Those curves on the survey key are cut into the cave walls too. #emotion:Worried
Survivor: The key needs a living route. Whatever is breathing down there might be the part the survey missed. #emotion:Worried
===
title: SurvivorNursery
---
Survivor: Eggs. All this time, under the cradle. Under my bunk. #emotion:Worried
Survivor: I'm shutting the drill down for good. Whatever is growing down there can have its quiet too. #emotion:Tender
===
title: SurvivorParcel
---
Taren: A delivery from the Halo. It's late. #emotion:Neutral
Survivor: Three cycles late. Socks. Coffee. And my sister's letter, written twice because the first one smudged. #emotion:Tender
Survivor: Tell Neve we got it. And tell her to stop sending socks. #emotion:Amused
<<setFlag neve.parcelDelivered>>
===
title: SurvivorBeaconsOffer
---
Survivor: The drill's quiet, but my crew planted evacuation beacons along both side trails before we shut the transmitter. #emotion:Worried
Survivor: Four of them are still calling. Anything built to follow a rescue signal will keep coming here. #emotion:Worried
Taren: Then we switch them off. #emotion:Determined
Survivor: Two on the west seam, two up the east service branch. Low masts, blue lights. Mind the hounds. #emotion:Neutral
<<startQuest SorrelBeacons>>
===
title: SurvivorBeaconsDone
---
Survivor: Four lights out. I can hear the wind again. #emotion:Tender
Survivor: Take the frame plating from our stores. We were saving it for a rescue that never came. Turns out you were the rescue. #emotion:Happy
<<setFlag sorrel.beaconsReported>>
===
